{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1150.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"547ea1aabafa8a160623548bc48efe1b0d101f401c0e0f7052dbaf58f3ccb2aa","ja":"公園の帰りに","zh":"回家路上的公园","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1150.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"1fb85e54513407460e0895eabfd84b7e7ee86a9c23d826fb99912aa4ea6670a6","ja":"もっとみんなと遊びたいのに帰らないとって、\n私も小さいころ、あった気がするなぁ。","zh":"明明还想和大家多玩一会儿，却不得不回家……\n我感觉自己小的时候，好像也经历过呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1150.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"3ce01c3ef46a974571db1da390e0c5eb586a3594378842e8e8dda2a2a73153a7","ja":"私もよく公園で友達とおままごとしてて、\n楽しいときにお迎えが来てたな。","zh":"我也经常在公园和朋友过家家，\n每次玩得正高兴就有人来接我回家了呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1150.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"199128249d1a27a5e287a6eba78cb47cb1b73577f8d4da25015c3e4184c727b8","ja":"楽しいことに夢中で\n時間を忘れちゃってるんだよね。","zh":"沉浸在开心的事情里，\n都忘了时间呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1150.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"c20dbc5d8a8cc75aec4e01579281988448262bbc7da2e2ad8a83218fb51e950a","ja":"あははっ、みんな同じなのかな♪\n志保ちゃんはそんな経験なかった？","zh":"啊哈哈，看来大家都一样呢♪\n志保以前没有过这种经历吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1150.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"2bd45a2c9693d060defb5c8c2bda244fb34d7cfd59018d7a811141eda2aa147a","ja":"いえ、私は……あったのかもしれませんけど、\nよく覚えてないですね。","zh":"不，我……可能确实有过，\n但已经不太记得了呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1150.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"b7a46778d7d41bd1270278ed750ef20e1c6284552d88d70413276f8f1d816a7a","ja":"あ、でも……弟は友達と遊んでる時じゃなくても、\nなんだか名残惜しそうな感じでした。","zh":"啊，不过……弟弟就算不是在和朋友玩的时候，\n也总觉得有些依依不舍的样子。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1150.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"82f08971c3c8e762283426b0c37711b63a679e8bb512781ed0a6532f6d9c8fb3","ja":"えっ、そうなの？　じゃあ……志保ちゃんと、\nもっと公園で遊びたかったってことなのかな？","zh":"诶，是这样吗？那……难道是说，\n还想和小志保在公园里多玩一会儿吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1150.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"ab868403f5a5ba2a58491ed88794b8e712f7cf5ba3d7fdf30946a67aead62fe4","ja":"えっ……！　でも私は、家に帰ってからも\n一緒に過ごしてますけど……？","zh":"咦……！可是我回家以后\n也一直待在一起啊……？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1150.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"f557d93da4c45cfc642cec589421e39c880a37bfd2de38e2c5013e31b6630672","ja":"『外で一緒に遊ぶ』っていうのが\n特別なのかもしれないよ？","zh":"“一起去外面玩”这件事，\n说不定本身就很特别哦？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1150.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"ad37bdea944363f4f298118edf05e108098658a843a8ee0025bbdf80f6887700","ja":"そうだね！　それなら……公園じゃなくても、\n帰りにちょっとだけ寄り道してみるとかどうかな！","zh":"说得对！　那样的话……就算不去公园，\n回去的路上顺便绕道去哪儿逛逛怎么样呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1150.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"abb88f9fb0503c46385ec107e6516af22a63c4488c409963d924b734c30febdc","ja":"寄り道、ですか……まあ、少しくらいなら……。","zh":"顺路逛逛吗……嗯，稍微逛一下的话……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
